    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d439">

                <pb facs="0680" n="633" xml:id="pg633"/>

                <head>439. Telegram 1475 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d439-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-01-11">January 11, 1956, 7:01
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d439-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d439-1"/>
                <p>1475. For Johnson. Your 1353.</p>
                <p>No public reply made to Peiping allegation.</p>
                <p>If Wang should raise subject you should reply this is irresponsible charge
                    similar to others made in past and you do not intend to engage in discussion of
                    it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
